{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "67e521a7a3449e1354eb699a2c301a56e9cc73549c31edac6b8b6cb1cd9b5340", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nナイスタイミングなのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你来得正好的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "aee456c7d51f74e961851fbfc240872a22698c3452719dd2275e1383902595f1", "ja": "今、衣装チェックをしていたところなのです。\n{$P$}さんの感想が聞きたいのです。", "zh": "公主正好在试装的喔。\n想听听{$P$}先生的感想的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1003_p", "source_sha256": "acc48ae893d0e134034c4754e8ad3a57dda99cdbab8b75f40f5f1f8aba7fedfe", "ja": "心配ないよ、よく似合ってる。\n本物のお姫さまみたいだぞ！", "zh": "你不用担心，很适合你。\n就像真正的公主一样喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "d3c4cf0378c1816e704221949ea533c95cfeaf353a49b03ef707a0fe5b16b514", "ja": "ほ？　{$P$}さん、違うのですよ。\n「みたい」じゃなくて、姫は本物の姫なのです。", "zh": "哦？{$P$}先生，这话不对喔。\n不是「就像」，公主就是真正的公主的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ba195e64c7b240c3f1803438fb68367538f009c37c3decbc03e50b89efe1eee5", "ja": "おっと、そうだったな。\nごめん、うっかりしてたよ。", "zh": "哎呀，说得也是。\n抱歉，我一时迷糊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "2f3c3df9f71e2c3d1b9d3626c313a519deeff232832eb7a70889e1db4c160ff3", "ja": "でも……今日の姫を本物にしてくれたのは、\n{$P$}さんもなのです。", "zh": "不过……今天的公主之所以成为真正的公主，\n也是多亏了{$P$}先生的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "519d68697e3db7072985db4192afeeac763021227fd3184841058396611c33fb", "ja": "この衣装が証拠なのです。言葉にしなくても、\n姫のお願いを、ちゃーんと叶えてくれたのです。", "zh": "这套服装就是证据。\n就算没说出口，你也完美实现了公主的愿望的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "5671e7cf1276c6264f582eb4664db093297ed155bf754ea3832fbd30f958b6ba", "ja": "白馬の王子様は、お姫様のお願いは絶対に\n叶えてくれるのです。絶対に、だよ？", "zh": "白马王子绝对会实现公主的愿望的喔。\n绝对会喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dc4ca196f5fa51707700b30e433e21c4aae25f30796c04ceceddb266d8f3f161", "ja": "それは……つまり、気に入ったってことか？", "zh": "意思是……你很喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "51628cda675f03cc3616f9835771e9dcbc68323bef45ca3b573ffa06e68d0ad5", "ja": "はいなのです♪　この衣装は、\n姫のかわいさを引き出してくれるのです！", "zh": "没错的喔♪\n这套服装有衬托出公主的可爱的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "d0e18f679555dc8bc6e14607f54bf41d5f08bf73e7a186517a72d509bc672d65", "ja": "うっとりまつりなのです～。\nファンのみんなも、きっと喜んでいるのです♪", "zh": "茉莉为它深深着迷的喔～\n粉丝一定也会很高兴的呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1012_p", "source_sha256": "77171a3329cb439bd18d12097ad41b35aaba07f6806749636598c0d7beb5091f", "ja": "あ、そうそう、それを伝えに来たんだった。\nブログの評判、すごくいい感じだぞ！", "zh": "啊，对了对了，我就是要来找你说这个。\n部落格上的评价，感觉很不错喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "9c39f35f47cf1b2f255fc3c07452cc84d46a82c66657c00cad83d6dcc1a172d2", "ja": "はいほー！　おまかせなのです。この新しい衣装で、\nみんなを、とびきり・はっぴー！にするのです♪", "zh": "Hi Ho～！交给公主的喔。公主会用这套新服装，\n让大家都变得超级开心的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8330a4882f6b5f7b293a612ab81e0ff297d7be0b16c719b4f87c6b550634f0d7", "ja": "なんだ。感想なんて聞いてくるから\n自信がないのかと思ったけど、心配なさそうだな。", "zh": "什么嘛。听你问我的感想，\n我还在想说你是不是没自信，看来不需要担心了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0064_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "a841900858c6480a21829f0ad8c2de79ddbae129d5ad0d91f2d2fea30b43e13a", "ja": "そんなことないのです。\n姫はただ……ううん。", "zh": "没这回事的喔。\n公主只是……不。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
